<view class="invite-page">
  <view class="invite-panel"><text class="invite-title">邀请好友 赢积分</text><text class="invite-copy">好友通过你的邀请首次登录，并首次获得观看积分后，双方均可获得邀请奖励。</text><view class="invite-code-strip"><text>我的邀请码</text><text>{{inviteCode}}</text></view><text class="invite-help">邀请码通过分享卡片或小程序码自动带给新用户，无需让好友手工填写。</text><view class="invite-stats"><view><text class="stat-value">{{inviteTotal}}</text><text class="stat-label">邀请总人数</text></view><view><text class="stat-value">{{inviteSuccess}}</text><text class="stat-label">已达标</text></view></view><button class="poster-trigger" bindtap="showPoster">生成邀请海报</button></view>
  <text class="invite-list-title">我邀请的好友</text><view wx:if="{{!items.length}}" class="empty-state">暂无邀请记录</view><view wx:else class="invite-list"><view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" class="invite-row"><text>{{item.invitee_name}}</text><text>{{item.status === 'REWARDED' ? '已达标' : '待完成观看'}}</text></view></view>
</view>
<view wx:if="{{posterVisible}}" class="poster-modal"><view class="poster-mask" bindtap="hidePoster"></view><view class="invite-poster"><button class="modal-close" bindtap="hidePoster">×</button><text class="poster-brand">Knowledge Points</text><text class="poster-title">看知识视频\n攒积分 · 兑好礼</text><image wx:if="{{miniCodeUrl}}" class="mini-code-image" src="{{miniCodeUrl}}" mode="aspectFit" /><view wx:else class="code-card"><text>我的邀请码</text><text>{{inviteCode}}</text></view><text class="poster-tip">正式环境显示可扫码小程序码；也可点击下方按钮分享带邀请关系的入口</text><button class="share-poster" open-type="share">分享给好友</button></view></view>
